                                    <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>Items should be collected within 45 days failing which ATS Calibration Labs will not be responsible for its safe custody and item will be disposed off as per ATS rules. No claim in this regard will be entertained later.</Value>
